Package: finalproject
Title: Exploring Public Health Datasets for BST260
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Ruoqi",
           family = "Xiao",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ruoqi_xiao@hsph.harvard.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-7304-8999"))
Description: This package collects public health datasets and the analyses
    built on them for the BST260 final project at the Harvard T.H. Chan
    School of Public Health. It documents the provenance of each dataset,
    provides descriptive statistics on the variables of interest, and states
    the investigative objectives. Quarto vignettes report the findings and
    limitations, and a pkgdown site presents them on GitHub Pages.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Suggests: knitr, testthat, rmarkdown, pkgdown, quarto
License: Artistic-2.0
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/RuoqiXiao/finalproject,
    https://ruoqixiao.github.io/finalproject/
BugReports: https://github.com/RuoqiXiao/finalproject/issues
